Onkyo Remote bundles third-party artwork.

Material Design Icons
https://pictogrammers.com/library/mdi/
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The SVG files in res/ are unmodified Material Design Icons: power, volume-off,
play-pause, volume-minus, volume-plus, skip-previous, skip-next, equalizer and
speaker. The 1-bit PNGs in images/ are generated from them by
tools/svg2icons.py and are derivative works of those icons.

Pictogrammers distributes the collection under the Pictogrammers Free License,
which places the icons under Apache 2.0 and states that the collection is GPL
friendly. The rest of this project is licensed under the GNU General Public
License v3.0; see LICENSE.
